---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Insights" active="insights">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Cautious signals</p>
      <h2>What might be worth watching?</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="soft-copy">These are gentle pattern notes, not diagnosis or certainty.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="pattern-visuals" class="pattern-visuals" aria-live="polite"></section>
  <section id="insight-list" class="insight-list" aria-live="polite"></section>
  <section class="plain-panel">
    <h3>How insights work</h3>
    <p>Insights are generated from entries saved in this browser. They get more useful after several days, and stronger patterns need more than one week of data.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="plain-panel">
    <h3>Relational stress scoring</h3>
    <p>Relationship stress, feeling trapped, and feeling unsupported count strongly. Conflict and self-silencing count moderately. Emotional conversations count lightly, because repair and connection can also be regulating.</p>
  </section>

  <script src="../scripts/insights.ts"></script>
</BaseLayout>
